WEBVTT

00:14:28.458 --> 00:14:30.893
(Laughter)

00:14:30.917 --> 00:14:35.018
(Applause)

00:14:35.042 --> 00:14:40.226
And in an economy as dependent
upon cooperation at scale as ours,

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:44.375
sociopathy is as bad for business
as it is for society.

00:14:45.375 --> 00:14:46.625
And fifth and finally,

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:50.667
unlike the laws of physics,

00:14:51.833 --> 00:14:55.375
the laws of economics are a choice.

00:14:56.542 --> 00:14:58.226
Now, neoliberal economic theory

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:03.268
has sold itself to you
as unchangeable natural law,